# Mr. Backupsy's Apply change list on Tower's mixed base profile (base/tower/profile-mixed.env), as plan-changes.mjs prints
# it for a plan made anew — exactly these keys. The base office applied everything else (the canary's [partner] too).
# A known product finding, not the base's (INV-TRUTH, 2026-10-25): the page keeps `app|Jellyfin|folder` for an app whose
# folder is a dataset of its own while its share goes to a partner (truth review T04, office 1.71.3), but engine 2.74's
# setup writes an [app] section only with kopia = yes or a partner (setup.sh ~2587) — the key never lands, the dialog lists
# it after every Apply, and the run still skips appdata at the partner («children»).
app|Jellyfin|folder
